__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Hypothesis writes its example database here. It self-ignores (it drops a
# `.gitignore` containing `*` inside the directory on first run), so this line
# is belt-and-braces: hypothesis only creates that file when it creates the
# directory, so a pre-existing `.hypothesis/` or a deleted self-ignore would
# otherwise leave the tree dirty.
.hypothesis/
